Validate

npx prettier --check .
git status --short
git diff --check
git diff -- .prettierignore

Important: .prettierignore controls formatting, not Git tracking or secret protection. The .vscode/ exceptions preserve the example files listed above, but adjust them if your repository uses a different set of shared configuration files. Avoid ignoring entire source directories such as api/, assets/, or education/, because they contain maintained MedOrbits code and content.